              "content": "This endpoint indicates whether the US market is open/close. Orders placed when market is closed are queued for the next trading session.\n\nMarket status information includes a boolean indicator for whether the market is currently active, Unix timestamp of the current market date, operating trading hours, and holiday schedule showing market closures on US federal holidays.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
